    <Tags>work item,work item twin,work item twins,work item synchronization,work item sync,azure devops,azure devops extension,sync,synchronization,clone,copy,duplicate,mirror,cross project,multi project,project sync,boards,azure boards,work item tracking,backlog,task,feature,bug,user story,epic,agile,scrum,kanban,project management,team collaboration,workflow,automation,productivity,devops,twin,link,relationship,track,manage,organize,bulk sync,bulk operations,batch sync,comment sync,discussion sync,comments,discussions,bidirectional sync,cross organization,cross-org sync,multi organization,organization sync,cross tenant,remote organization,entra id,azure ad,oauth,field sync,work item copy,work item mirror,cross-org,multi-org</Tags>
